~\mcp-test                      no sandbox        gemini-3.5-flash-lite</code></pre>

      <p class="detail-paragraph">
        On the left is the working folder (should be <code>~\mcp-test</code>); on the right, the model (should be <code>gemini-3.5-flash-lite</code>). Further right it also shows <code>1 MCP server</code>.
